          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mul 11.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini akuma nani jed'ani kaani fage, qilleensi kaani reefa kaani duude, reefi suni ch'ufti lubbu horate oli ejaanje duula gudda tae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Waaqi waan nani jed'e, Namicha, worri Israeli akuma lafele tana jira. Worri waan jed'u, Nu yayu gogonne, ufi jibbaanne, waan iti yaanule wollaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi fagi, waan atini worra kiyya ka Israelitini jettu, Anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, awaala keesani bane reefa keesani keesaa fuud'e, lafa Israeliti isani deebisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo anini irreesa iti isani awaalani bane keesaa isani yaase, isani gumiini tiyya, aka anini AABBO Waaqa beetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini hafuura kiyya isani keesa kaye lubbu isaniti deebise lafa teesani keesa isani teesisa. Duuba akasiini aka dubbi tana AABBO Waaqi jed'e ammalle guute beetani. Nami dubbi tana jed'e, ana, AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yudafi Israeliini takaa taate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Waaqi nani dubbate waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, ule toko fuud'i, uleeni tunini ta worra Yuda jed'i, irati t'aafi ule d'ibile fuud'i uleeni tunini ta worra Israeli jed'i, irati t'aafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ule suni lachu mata wolti d'aabi, ule toko fakeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja biyyiti, wonti kunini maani? Jette si gaafatte, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jettuuni wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Anini ule Yudatifi ta Israeli fuud'e, ule tana lamaani ule takaa tolche, isiini harka kiyya keesati takaa taati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ule lamaani tana olfuud'i biyya garsiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan jettuuni, wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana. Anini nama kiyya ka gosa d'ibi keesa jiru keesaa fuud'e wolti deebise lafa isaaniti galcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gaareeni Israeli irati worra ch'ufa nama takaa ka lafa toko, tolcha. Duuba hayyuuni toko worra fide, worri deebie gosa lama ta hayyooti lama fiddu intahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri deebie waaqoota harkaani boch'ani kad'ate waan hamtu tolche, akasiini ufi int'ureesu. Anini kara worri dabaani tolche nara goruni ch'ufa worra iraa gorse worra qulqulleesa. Duuba worri gumi tiyya tae, aninileeni Waaqa worraa taha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 34.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni hojattu tiyya Daudi fakaatu toko hayyu worraa tae, worri hayyu takaa jalati bule aadaafi seera kiyya aka dansaa guuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa anini hojattu tiyya Yakobo kenne, ta ababooti worraa keesa teete, keesa tae, worraafi ilmaani worraatifi d'alooti worraa ch'ufti haga jiru jireenna achuma taa. Ammalle hayyu hojattu tiyya Daudi fakaatuti haga jiru jireenna worra mohata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
