        },
        {
          "text": "Anini wold'aqisa nagaya, ka haga jiru jireenna jiru, worraani woliini tolfad'a. Anini worra jabeese, daraarse deebanse, Mana kiyya ka haga jiru jireenna tau lafa worra keesati jaarad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
